message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. / このソフトウェアを使った場合は、以下のとおり引用してください。"
title: "TEMer Plus: a drawing tool for the Trajectory Equifinality Model (TEM)"
abstract: "TEMer Plus is a browser-based tool for drawing diagrams of the Trajectory Equifinality Model (TEM), a qualitative research method in cultural psychology. It supports boxes, paths, social direction and social guidance, period labels, transcript links, and export to PNG, SVG, PDF, PPTX and a Word report for papers."
type: software
